&lt;p&gt;Slash into summer with a tall drink of terror, all from your favorite chillers and killers! In "Sunday Pt. II," Ryan North and Giada Belviso send a Bride of Christ over the deep end into madness. Then, Rich Douek and Stevan Subic lead you down a bloody path to the old west, where a brash young gunfighter seeks a showdown with "The Man Who Outdrew Death." And finally, sink into the cool, briny depths of Kelly Williams’s “Old Wounds” when a grizzled light housekeeper hears the call of the sea one final time. Beat the heat with an all-new pool of fresh nightmares and dive right into horror’s deep end!&lt;/p&gt;
